   "evidence": "ParityOdd.lean:183-188 \u2014 the body is `rw [hp, map_add, map_smul, LinearMap.add_apply, LinearMap.smul_apply, hW.conserved_left, smul_zero, add_zero]` after `hp : K.p = pTransverse g K + (g K.p K.q / g K.q K.q) \u2022 K.q`; no other field of `hW` appears. Contrast ParityOdd.lean:167-180, where `apply_pTransverse_eq_zero` genuinely uses `proper_covariant`, `isAlt.self_eq_zero` and `conserved_right`. Its only caller is ParityOdd.lean:196, which holds a full bundle and so loses nothing.",
